## 订阅（Subscription）

### $subscribe — 监听 state 变化

```typescript
const store = useCounterStore();

store.$subscribe(
  (mutation, state) => {
    console.log('变化类型:', mutation.type);
    console.log('Store ID:', mutation.storeId);
    console.log('新状态:', state);
  },
  {
    detached: true,
  },
);
```

| mutation.type    | 说明                         |
| ---------------- | ---------------------------- |
| `direct`         | 直接修改 `store.xxx = value` |
| `patch object`   | `store.$patch({})`           |
| `patch function` | `store.$patch(() => {})`     |

### $onAction — 监听 action 调用

```typescript
const unsubscribe = store.$onAction(
  ({ name, store, args, after, onError }) => {
    console.log(`Action "${name}" 被调用，参数:`, args);

    after((result) => {
      console.log(`Action "${name}" 返回:`, result);
    });

    onError((error) => {
      console.warn(`Action "${name}" 抛出错误:`, error);
    });
  },
  true, // detached: 组件卸载后仍然监听
);
```

